        "source_message_id": 54,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Hey! I wanted to send over the vision for the website.\n\nThe goal is to build a national brand website for SHATTER HOUSE that can support multiple locations and future franchise growth.\n\nMain Website:\nhttps://shatterhouseusa.example\n\nFor the visual direction, use a clean, modern, mobile-friendly design with simplicity similar to RageWorks USA. The branding should combine black, purple, and white with large images, generous spacing, and easy navigation.\n\nHomepage Sections:\n\nHero Banner\nLocation Selector\nRage Rooms\nAxe Throwing\nSplatter Room\nCorporate Events\nBirthday Parties\nReviews\nFAQ\nContact\n\nThe homepage should immediately show visitors what we offer and allow them to select their location.\n\nCurrent Locations:\n\nLinden Falls\nPort Averly\nRidgehaven\n\nGive every location its own dedicated page while keeping the design and branding consistent across all locations. The website should be built so future locations can be added easily without redesigning the site.\n\nFuture examples:\n\nMesa Crest\nHighpoint\nRiverbend\nFranchise Locations\n\nThe overall feel should be a national entertainment brand, not a local business website."
