        "source_message_id": 55,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Ridgehaven will operate on its own Wix account and must remain separate from Harbor Valley Shatter House.\n\nRidgehaven needs its own:\n\nBookings\nCustomer database\nAnalytics\nMemberships\nGift cards\nPayment processing\nStaff access\nPayouts\n\nI want customers to feel like they are visiting the same SHATTER HOUSE brand, but the backend operations need to stay completely separate.\n\nFor now, Ridgehaven should be built as a “Coming Soon” location.\n\nRidgehaven Page Layout:\n\nHero Banner\nRage Rooms\nAxe Throwing\nSplatter Room\nCorporate Events\nBirthday Parties\nFAQ\nPhoto Gallery\nContact Information\nVIP Email Signup\n\nButtons:\n\nJoin VIP List\nOpening Soon\n\nBuild the page so that once Ridgehaven opens, we only need to turn on booking and update the photos without redesigning anything. The Ridgehaven page should then become the template for future locations."
